        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3721, Fancy Ribbed Cabinet Drop Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe love this pull for its sophisticated styling. The Fancy Ridged Drop Pull made by RK International features a beautiful lined design that adds interest to its classic style. A hanging pull, this solid brass cabinet handle has an interesting shape as opposed to typical straight across pulls. It is available in three sizes: 5 inches c.c., 8 inches c.c., 12 inches c.c. Choose any of the 5 available finishes for a truly beautiful finishing touch to your cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-9308\"><b>Fancy Ridged Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-3718\"><b>Fancy Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-ribbed-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-4718\"><b>12 Inch Fancy Ridged Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3721 Indian Drum Hanging Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3721</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3722</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3723</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
